        <mxCell id="c112" value="Alternative flow — cancellation (not drawn inline)&lt;br&gt;The owning donor, or an administrator, may move a donation to&lt;br&gt;CANCELLED from AVAILABLE, MATCHED, ACCEPTED, VOLUNTEER_ASSIGNED&lt;br&gt;or PICKED_UP. CANCELLED is terminal. Implemented and tested in&lt;br&gt;the API; not yet offered by the web portal.&lt;br&gt;Why the status history matters&lt;br&gt;Every StatusEvent above is stamped by the server, never by the&lt;br&gt;client. GET /api/metrics derives median time-to-claim, median&lt;br&gt;handover time, rescue rate and expiry-loss rate from exactly&lt;br&gt;these rows." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A7F72;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1164" y="2644" width="486" height="215" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
